msgid "prompt.reply_language"
msgstr "Summarize and reply in user's language or follow user's prompt."

msgid "prompt.task_control_protocol"
msgstr ""
"## Task control protocol\n"
"Each new task starts in OPEN state; do not infer chat/execution from wording. "
"Call a real tool whenever external state must be inspected or changed. "
"After any real tool call, the task is EXECUTING and must finish with "
"provider-native complete_task(answer, evidence_refs), citing relevant successful "
"ledger records. Answer-only tasks may call complete_task with no evidence_refs. "
"Use ask_user only when user input is required. Do not end an executed task with "
"plain text."


